cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Pakistan</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=10930'  TARGET='_top' >Umbelliferae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5&start_taxon_id=10930'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Heracleum</b> Linn., Sp. Pl.  249.  1753.  Gen. Pl. ed. 5. 118. 1754; Boiss., Fl. Or. 2: 1039. 1872; C.B. Clarke in Hook. f., Fl. Brit. Ind. 2:711. 1879; Hiroe, Umb. Asia 1 :189. 1958; Brummitt in Tutin et al, Fl. Eur. 2:364. 1968.  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nPlants perennial, pubescent. Leaves simple or compound, 1-3-pinnate. Rays 3 to numerous. Involucre of a few bracts or lacking. Involucel of a few to many linear to lanceolate or oval bractlets. Calyx teeth evident or obsolete. Petals white, rarely yellow, outer petals of the outer flowers in an umbel larger. Fruit elliptic, strongly compressed dorsally, oblong, obovate, orbicular or pyriform; dorsal and intermediate ridges prominent or not prominent, not winged; lateral ridges winged; furrows 1-vittate; commissure 2-vittate; vittae filiform or clavate, usually not extending (rarely extending) to the base of the fruit. Inner seed face plane.<p>\r\n\r\nA fairly large genus with over 70 species found in the temperate regions, mostly in Europe and Asia.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nDistribution: Himalayas in India and Pakistan, USSR, Europe. <p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Cauline leaves simple</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Cauline leaves compound</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-2'>2</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves tripartite; apex acute</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063087'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum leucocarpum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves ovate to cordate; apex obtuse</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063089'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum polyadenum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-3'>3</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf segments 10-20 cm long, 8-15 cm broad. plants up to 2 m tall</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200015565'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum candicans</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf segments less than 10 cm long. plans up to 1m tall</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-4'>4</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf segments linear to lanceolate, entire or oval to ovate and deeply toothed</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063090'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum cachemiricum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaf segments ovate to rotund, crenate to serrate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-5'>5</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants villous; hairs white. Ovaries and young fruits densely pubescent</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200015566'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum canescens</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants not villous; pubescent. Ovaries and young Fruits minutely pubescent</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063092'  TARGET='_top' >Heracleum pinnatum</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063090' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>cachemiricum</b>  C.B. Clarke</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200015565' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>candicans</b>  Wall. ex DC.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200015566' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>canescens</b>  Lindl.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063087' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>leucocarpum</b>  Aitch. & Hemsl.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063092' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>pinnatum</b>  C.B. Clarke</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063089' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>polyadenum</b>  Rech. f. & Riedl</A></ul>\n<p>\n<p>\n<B>Related Synonym(s):</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063088' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Heracleum</i> <i>afghanicum</i>  Kitam. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063087' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>leucocarpum</b>  Aitch. & Hemsl.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250063091' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Heracleum</i> <i>hirsutum</i>  Edgew. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200015566' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Heracleum</b> <b>canescens</b>  Lindl.</A></A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"right\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"lblGalleryLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span>&nbsp;</TD>\r\n                                </TR>\r\n                              </TABLE>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <span id=\"lblObjectList\"><p>\n<TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' \n\t cellspacing=0>\n<TR >\n  <td class='bold'>Flora of China</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td width=400><li><A HREF='http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/PDF/PDF14/Heracleum.pdf' \n\tTITLE='PDF' >PDF File</A></td>\n  <td class='small'>PDF</td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r